<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">years as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, respectively.
The weighted-average IBR was <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent_iI_dp_c20260630_zH8QTRuvFdi1"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30" id="Fact000831" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">9.06</ix:nonFraction></span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">%
