respectively, of common stock were issued and outstanding. No shares of preferred stock have been issued.</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During the six months
