offset by $3,000 in interest expense. Other expense in the three months ended June 30, 2025 included $15,000 in loss on sale of property
and equipment and $4,000 in interest expense.</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Other income was
